From: Tenda AC8 OpenWrt port
Subject: net: export dev_change_name for the rtl8192cd vendor driver

The Realtek rtl8192cd driver pre-creates its VAP and repeater netdevs and
swaps their names when cfg80211 asks for an interface of the other type
(realtek_cfg80211_add_iface -> rtk_change_netdev_name).  The Realtek SDK
kernels export dev_change_name() for that; do the same.  The caller holds
RTNL (nl80211 NEW_INTERFACE).
---
--- a/net/core/dev.c
+++ b/net/core/dev.c
@@ -1344,6 +1344,7 @@
 
 	return err;
 }
+EXPORT_SYMBOL(dev_change_name);
 
 /**
  *	dev_set_alias - change ifalias of a device
